entries.def:
υἱός, -οῦ, ὁ, [in LXX very frequently and nearly always for בֵּן, Gen.4.17, al.; for בַּר, Dan.7.13, al.; etc. ;], 
a son; 
__1. in the ordinary sense: Mat.10.37, Mrk.9.17, Luk.1.13, al. mult.; omitted with the art. of origin (WM, §30, 3; Bl., §35, 2), τὸν τοῦ Ἰεσσαί, Act.13.22 (LXX); also with genitive anarth. (cl.), Σώπατρος Πύρρου Βεροιαῖος, Act.20.4 with adj., προτότοκος, Luk.2.7 μονογένης, Luk.7.12 opposite to…
